{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__apply-patch#card-zh","repo":"JohnXu22786/apply-patch","commit":"5f74c21018e2b5e856a56936fdb0bc4bf95691e6","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-patch-apply 为 DSH 注册四个 unified diff 工具：应用补丁、预览校验、生成反向补丁和统计差异。它解析多文件 git diff，通过精确匹配、行号偏移或有限上下文模糊匹配定位 hunk，并在写入前校验全部操作；应用时可记录撤销日志。也可作为 Node.js 命令行工具和 TypeScript 库使用，适合需要在开发流程中批量修改代码并查看冲突、保留恢复路径的场景。需要 Node.js 18 以上，无需 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:19-45","src/tools.ts:150-177","src/apply.ts:381-524"]}
{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__apply-patch#card-en","repo":"JohnXu22786/apply-patch","commit":"5f74c21018e2b5e856a56936fdb0bc4bf95691e6","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-patch-apply adds four DSH tools to apply, preview, reverse, and summarize unified diffs. It parses multi-file patches, locates hunks with exact, offset, or limited fuzzy matching, validates before writing, and can record an undo journal. A Node.js CLI and TypeScript library are included.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:19-45","src/tools.ts:150-177","src/apply.ts:381-524"]}
