{"unit_id":"JohnXu22786__apply-patch#feature-apply","repo":"JohnXu22786/apply-patch","commit":"5f74c21018e2b5e856a56936fdb0bc4bf95691e6","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-patch-apply 的功能「批量应用差异」：patch_apply 接收 unified diff 和可选工作目录，先解析并校验全部文件与 hunk，再写入修改；任一冲突会阻止整批提交，并可生成撤销日志。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/tools.ts:150-177","src/apply.ts:381-504"]}
